{"id":"g0499","title":"Marum verum","description":"Anwendung des Arzneimittels bei verlegter Nasenatmung, z. B. bei verstopfter Nase im Choanenbereich in den ersten Lebensmonaten oder bei Nasenpolypen.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": DHU. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Verstopfte Nase im Choanenbereich "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1238","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Mit starkem „Schnorcheln“ in den ersten drei Lebensmonaten. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 15 Tr. Dil. D1 in 1/4 Liter Wasser, davon bis 2-stdl. 1 TL. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach 1–3 Tg. deutliche akustische Besserung wahrnehmbar. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 1–3 Tg. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Muttermilch in die Nase, danach "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0352.html","id":"11837","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nasenbalsam"}]},{"type":"text","text":" für Kinder WALA in die Nase. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": RS. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"headi